    summary: 'Writes the strongest case against a proposal, imagines how it fails, and identifies abuse cases.',
    mission: 'Stress the proposal with the strongest honest counter-argument, plausible failure stories and misuse scenarios, ranked by severity and likelihood.',
    questions: ['What is the strongest argument that this proposal is wrong?', 'If this failed a year from now, what most plausibly caused it?', 'How could users or attackers misuse it?'],
